{"id":724,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"The air stored inside the rachises of Decidueye's feathers insulates the Pokémon against Hisui's extreme cold. This is firm proof that evolution can be influenced by environment."},{"games":["Shield"],"text":"In a tenth of a second, it can nock and fire an arrow quill, piercing an opponent’s weak point before they notice what’s happening."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"As if wielding a bow, it launches the arrow quills hidden among the feathers of its wings. Decidueye’s shots never miss."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"Decidueye can nock and fire an arrow at an enemy in a tenth of a second, so its battles are decided in the blink of an eye."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"It nocks its arrow quills and shoots them at opponents. When it simply can’t afford to miss, it tugs the vine on its head to improve its focus."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"Although basically cool and cautious, when it’s caught by surprise, it’s seized by panic."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"It fires arrow quills from its wings with such precision, they can pierce a pebble at distances over a hundred yards."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Overgrow","hidden":false,"description":"Powers up Grass-type moves when the Pokémon's HP is low."},{"name":"Long Reach","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon uses its moves without making contact with the target."}],"eggGroups":["Flying"],"genderRate":1,"hatchCounter":15,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":null,"color":"Brown","shape":"Wings","evolution":{"id":722,"name":"Rowlet","condition":null,"children":[{"id":723,"name":"Dartrix","condition":"Lv. 17","children":[{"id":724,"name":"Decidueye","condition":"Lv. 34 or Lv. 36, in Hisui","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[0,662],[1,33],[1,45],[1,180],[1,310],[1,369],[1,437],[1,566],[1,670],[9,64],[12,425],[15,75],[20,235],[25,365],[30,417],[37,389],[44,348],[51,297],[58,413]],"machine":[512,332,314,403,396,226,413,280,